WEBVTT

00:07:57.836 --> 00:08:00.356
Another big idea in the book
is this idea of scarcity,

00:08:00.396 --> 00:08:01.716
that there's certain seats,

00:08:01.716 --> 00:08:03.796
and that my seat
is taking a seat from him,

00:08:03.796 --> 00:08:05.996
is a really old way of thinking
about the world

00:08:06.036 --> 00:08:07.236
and thinking about power.

00:08:07.276 --> 00:08:08.556
I believe power can grow.

00:08:08.556 --> 00:08:10.276
I believe the pie can grow.

00:08:10.316 --> 00:08:14.756
If we all continue to think narrowly
that there's limited possibilities,

00:08:14.756 --> 00:08:18.116
I just think we're stuck
in a very unhealthy way of working

00:08:18.156 --> 00:08:20.116
and a really unhealthy way of being.

00:08:20.116 --> 00:08:23.636
WPR: And we're really fortunate today
to be joined by a few women

00:08:23.676 --> 00:08:28.116
who are like, in many ways, the women
whose stories you shared in the book

00:08:28.156 --> 00:08:30.236
and can share their own stories